WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
"The greatest man in
Raveloe was Squire Cass".

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.050
His Red House has stone steps and stables.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.580
On Sunday, even leaving
church follows rank.

4
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:13.200
The important families walk out first.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.570
Everyone else waits by the wall.

6
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.180
His son Godfrey is hiding a secret,
and means to keep his place.

7
00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.290
A pair of scales appears.

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.980
Can a man of rank keep his
secret, and pay nothing?

9
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:29.240
In this mission, you'll climb
Raveloe's ladder of rank,

10
00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.140
from the Squire down to the outsiders.

11
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.950
You'll see what a squire was, in a
war-time when landowners grew rich.

12
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.040
And you'll get inside Godfrey's head,
as he plans to take a weaver's child.

13
00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:45.900
Your mission: decide whether
Godfrey really escapes.
